--- !u!114 &200036979
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 200036976}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 150d5bd920204e94592fefc8db3c24d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AIDrivenNPCs.Runtime::AISystem.NPCKnowledge
  privateFacts: The skeletons took the Blue Stone from your house. You do not know
    where they went. Nora at the inn saw something that night.
  stageDialogue:
  - stageId: intro
    goal: Ask the traveller to bring the Blue Stone back. If they ask where to start,
      say Nora at the inn was awake that night.
    openingLine: Traveller, wait. Skeletons took our Blue Stone two nights ago. Will
      you help us get it back?
  - stageId: started
    goal: Hear what the traveller found out. If they are stuck, say Nora at the inn
      was awake that night.
    openingLine: You're back. Any sign of the Blue Stone?
  - stageId: found
    goal: Ask the traveller to hand you the Blue Stone.
    openingLine: Is that the Blue Stone? Please, give it to me.
  - stageId: complete
    goal: Thank the traveller and tell them Elmford will not forget them.
    openingLine: Elmford owes you everything, friend.
